| Command                             | Description                                                                         | Example                                |
| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `ollama`                            | Show Ollama help and available commands.                                            | `ollama`                               |
| `ollama run <model>`                | Download (if needed) and start chatting with a model.                               | `ollama run llama3.2`                  |
| `ollama list`                       | List all models installed on your computer.                                         | `ollama list`                          |
| `ollama ps`                         | Show models that are currently loaded and running.                                  | `ollama ps`                            |
| `ollama stop <model>`               | Stop a running model.                                                               | `ollama stop llama3.2`                 |
| `ollama pull <model>`               | Download a model without starting it.                                               | `ollama pull mistral`                  |
| `ollama rm <model>`                 | Remove a model from your computer.                                                  | `ollama rm llama3.2`                   |
| `ollama show <model>`               | Display detailed information about a model.                                         | `ollama show llama3.2`                 |
| `ollama cp <source> <new>`          | Create a copy of a model with a new name.                                           | `ollama cp llama3.2 mymodel`           |
| `ollama create <name> -f Modelfile` | Create a custom model from a Modelfile.                                             | `ollama create travelbot -f Modelfile` |
| `ollama serve`                      | Start the Ollama server manually (usually starts automatically after installation). | `ollama serve`                         |
| `ollama help`                       | Display help information.                                                           | `ollama help`                          |
| `ollama help run`                   | Show help for the `run` command.                                                    | `ollama help run`                      |
| `ollama version`                    | Show the installed Ollama version.                                                  | `ollama version`                       |

==============

Model Management Commands

| Command                | Purpose                       |
| ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| `ollama pull llama3.2` | Download the Llama 3.2 model. |
| `ollama pull mistral`  | Download the Mistral model.   |
| `ollama pull gemma3`   | Download the Gemma 3 model.   |
| `ollama pull qwen3`    | Download the Qwen 3 model.    |
| `ollama pull phi4`     | Download the Phi 4 model.     |
| `ollama list`          | View all downloaded models.   |
| `ollama rm mistral`    | Delete the Mistral model.     |

==============

