Typical Ollama Workflow

| Step                  | Command                                  |
| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Install Ollama        | Download and install from **ollama.com** |
| Download a model      | `ollama pull llama3.2`                   |
| Start chatting        | `ollama run llama3.2`                    |
| List installed models | `ollama list`                            |
| View model details    | `ollama show llama3.2`                   |
| Check running models  | `ollama ps`                              |
| Stop a model          | `ollama stop llama3.2`                   |
| Remove a model        | `ollama rm llama3.2`                     |


===========

Example Session
# Show installed models
ollama list

# Download Llama 3.2
ollama pull llama3.2

# Start chatting
ollama run llama3.2

# Show model details
ollama show llama3.2

# Check running models
ollama ps

# Stop the model
ollama stop llama3.2

# Remove the model
ollama rm llama3.2

This set of commands covers the ones you'll use most often for downloading, running, managing, and customizing models in Ollama.

